    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d940">

                <pb facs="0891" n="885" xml:id="pg885"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">867.5151/160: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">MacMurray</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ankara</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-12-07T16:00:00+02:00">December 7, 1939—4
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received December 7—1:30 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>154. My telegram No. 149, November 25, 2 p.m. Exchange transfers have been
                    effected on all applications filed prior to March 10. Unpaid applications on
                    file on December 4 total $6,300,000. Total payments made on applications filed
                    in 1939 (not including payments to petroleum companies) amount to
                    $1,216,000.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
